From 2347d51a52ffe5f3ad670bab201c24570a2aecf8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:44:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LineageParts: describe the anonymous statistics truthfully

The statistics screen said its data helps Evolution X and goes to its
developers, but the upload goes to stats.lineageos.org. The screen is
not reachable on this build (its catalog entry and the reporting
services are commented out); name the real recipient anyway, and drop
the translations that repeat the old claim.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
